==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Cognate to {{cog|krl|lokka}}. Compare {{cog|et|lõugas||gull}}.<ref>{{R:fi:SSA}}</ref> Probably {{onomatopoeic|fi|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[gull]], [[seagull]] {{gloss|any bird of the genus {{taxfmt|Larus|genus}} within the family {{taxfmt|Laridae|family}}}}
# {{lb|fi|taxonomy}} [[gull]], [[seagull]] {{gloss|any bird of the family Laridae}}
# {{lb|fi|colloquial}} One that [[beg]]s for [[handouts]] from their friends, particularly [[food]] or [[drink]]; a [[mooch]].

====Usage notes====
In common usage the word {{m|fi||lokki}} only refers to birds of genus {{taxfmt|Larus|genus}}, but in taxonomy the term covers whole of the family Laridae.

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-risti|lo|kk|k|a}}

